  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Acc&#xE8;s aux services de sant&#xE9; sexuelle et reproductive pour contribuer &#xE0; la r&#xE9;duction de la mortalit&#xE9; maternelle et des violences bas&#xE9;es sur le Genre, en situation de graves inondations, en R&#xE9;publique du Congo.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide protection and health assistance to people affected by flooding, in particular vulnerable women, girls, and teenagers. In particular, through this project UNFPA implement life-saving activities to strengthen and improve existing sexual and reproductive health services, and to address protection needs stemming from gender-based violence. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 80,774 people, including 20,280 women, 40,805 children, and 1,231 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
